### 正常系：単一拠点（B001）
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "0000000000015",
  "org_id": "TEP",
  "building_id": "B102",
  "agreement_category": "03",
  "target_month": "202407"
}

### エラー系：存在しない building_id
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "1234567890123",
  "org_id": "ORG001",
  "fiscal_year": "2024",
  "building_id": "ZZZZ",
  "report_classify": "6"
}

### エラー系：building_id 不足
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "1234567890123",
  "org_id": "ORG001",
  "fiscal_year": "2024",
  "report_classify": "6"
}

### エラー系：building_id = null
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "1234567890123",
  "org_id": "ORG001",
  "fiscal_year": "2024",
  "building_id": null
}

### 正常系：別建物 B002
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "1234567890123",
  "org_id": "ORG001",
  "fiscal_year": "2024",
  "building_id": "B002"
}
